diff --git a/ChangeLog b/ChangeLog
index 5a79cce..efcec0c 100644
--- a/ChangeLog
+++ b/ChangeLog
@@ -14,7 +14,7 @@
 
 - remove redundant accessibility checks from predictor, helix and seed handling
 
-- C++23 required; build and installation checks with GCC 14 and Apple Clang
+- C++17 required; build and installation checks with GCC 11, GCC 14 and Apple Clang
 - reduce temporary allocations and fix cleanup on error paths
 - avoid repeated partition-map lookups in exact ensemble prediction
 - add exhaustive interaction and seed oracles for short-sequence tests
@@ -38,6 +38,19 @@
 ################################################################################  
 ################################################################################
 
+260921
+ * configure.ac / .github/workflows/build.yml / README.md :
+   * lower the required C++ standard to C++17 (issue #244)
+   * check unordered_map::try_emplace and compile consumers in C++17 mode
+   + GCC 11 CI build alongside GCC 14 and Apple Clang
+ * IntaRNA/RnaSequence : use find() for alphabet and ambiguity checks
+ * IntaRNA/AccessibilityVrna / InteractionEnergyVrna :
+   * fill sized C++ strings instead of requiring resize_and_overwrite()
+ * IntaRNA/OutputHandlerCsv / OutputHandlerEnsemble / OutputHandlerText :
+   * use str() for output insertion instead of requiring stream views
+ * tests/RnaSequence_test.cpp : normalization and boundary ambiguity regression
+ + doc/refactor/5-c++17.md : standard audit and compatibility tradeoffs
+
 260919 Alexander Mitrofanov
  * IntaRNA/PredictorMfe2d* :
  * IntaRNA/PredictorMfeEns2d* :
